<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Application Approved</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f9;padding:40px 0;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">

    <!-- Header -->
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="background:#2563eb;padding:30px;">
            <h1 style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:28px;">
                HealthCare
            </h1>
        </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Body -->
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:40px;">

            <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:#222;">
                Application Approved!
            </h2>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Dear <strong>Dr. <%= name %></strong>,
            </p>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                We are pleased to inform you that your medical credentials have been successfully reviewed and **approved** by our administration team. 
            </p>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Your professional profile is now active on the HealthCare platform. You can begin managing your availability, accepting patient consultations, and updating your digital clinic dashboard.
            </p>

            <!-- Robust Cross-Client Success Badge -->
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:30px 0;">
                <tr>
                    <td align="center">
                        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#eff6ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:16px 30px; color:#2563eb; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center;">
                                    ✓ Provider Profile Activated
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Please sign in to your dedicated provider portal using your verified account details to complete any remaining onboarding documentation.
            </p>

            <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin:30px 0;">

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Welcome to our network. Thank you for partnering with us to deliver exceptional medical care.
            </p>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Warm regards,<br>
                <strong>The HealthCare Credentialing Team</strong>
            </p>

        </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="background:#f9fafb;padding:25px;">

            <p style="margin:0;color:#777;font-size:14px;">
                © <%= year %> HealthCare. All rights reserved.
            </p>

            <p style="margin-top:8px;color:#999;font-size:12px;">
                This is an automated notification regarding your provider account. Please do not reply directly to this message.
            </p>

        </td>
    </tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
